@startuml
[*] --> EmailListDisplayed
EmailListDisplayed --> [*] : exit application
EmailListDisplayed --> EmailsSortedByCriteria : sort emails
EmailListDisplayed --> EmailDeleted : delete email
EmailListDisplayed --> EmailMarkedAsUnread : mark email as unread

EmailsSortedByCriteria --> EmailListDisplayed : return to list
EmailDeleted --> EmailListDisplayed : return to list
EmailMarkedAsUnread --> EmailListDisplayed : return to list
@enduml
